OL,3,GNEWSAHouse that looks like boulders to
OL,4,Abe built on moor
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a house designed to look like
OL,7,Frocks on a famous Yorkshire moor have
OL,8,Fbeen approved.
OL,10,FThe contemporary structure, which has
OL,11,Flarge irregular-shaped windows and a
OL,12,Fnatural outdoor pool, looks similar to
OL,13,Fthe landmark Cow and Calf Rocks in
OL,14,FIlkley, West Yorkshire.
OL,16,FThe house will be built on green belt
OL,17,Fland which is the garden of a home off
OL,18,FHeber's Ghyll Drive, and will be
OL,19,Feco-friendly, to an ultra-low energy
OL,20,Fstandard called Passivhaus.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
