OL,3,GNEWSAHouse that looks like boulders to
OL,4,Abe built on moor
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarrogate-based architects Shaw &
OL,7,FJagger said the scheme was eventually
OL,8,Fpassed by HM Planning Inspectorate
OL,9,Fthrough the country house clause, which
OL,10,Fallows development on green belt for
OL,11,Fbuildings of "exceptional quality".
